# Sessions

One directory per program: `sessions/<program-slug>/`.

One file per mentoring session inside the program directory:
`YYYY-MM-DD-<topic-slug>.md`. Preps, drill artifacts, and feedback files for a
session live alongside its log in the same directory.

Ad-hoc sessions (no active program, `-y` waiver) go under `sessions/ad-hoc/`.

Created by `@cto-mentor run` / `prepare`.
